{%- comment -%}
  DELIBERATELY EMPTY.

  This section used to render 26 review cards with invented names, invented
  Instagram handles, fake verified check marks and fake like counts, on a store
  that has never had a customer. It also quoted a completely different spec
  sheet from the rest of the site, which made it evidence of fabrication rather
  than merely untrue.

  It was removed from templates/index.json and templates/product.json. The file
  itself is emptied rather than deleted because the Admin API refuses to delete
  theme files; leaving the old markup here would mean a single click in the
  theme editor could put all of it back on the storefront.

  Review fraud is actionable separately from ordinary marketing claims in the
  US, the UK and the EU, and it is one of the few things a payment processor
  treats as disqualifying rather than fixable. Do not repopulate this file with
  sample copy. When there are real reviews, use a review app that keeps them
  tied to real verified orders.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "XERO reviews",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This section is intentionally empty. It previously shipped fabricated reviews and must not be repopulated with sample copy. Use a review app backed by verified orders."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
